            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Thor apresenta gráficos de 16 bits e jogabilidade centrada no uso do Mjölnir, conduzindo nosso herói nórdico por níveis desafiadores com vários tipos de obstáculos. Oferece controles rígidos, ação em ritmo acelerado e uma experiência tingida de nostalgia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/91b4be79715ae7daf568fb850c4fa35a.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" width=48 height=41 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/91b4be79715ae7daf568fb850c4fa35a.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Mjölnir, Ferramenta dos Deuses</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/c446fdd303f9c37f58d030b4e1a2230e.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" width=48 height=41 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/c446fdd303f9c37f58d030b4e1a2230e.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“É seu aniversário, Thor! Agora pegue o Mjölnir, o martelo que nunca erra o alvo!” -Odin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tudo foi cuidadosamente pensado em torno desta premissa. O martelo pode ser apontado livremente, ele ricocheteia em superfícies e inimigos, permitindo todos os tipos de lançamentos complicados.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/c4a306764392d49cee20ab5f98aeb59f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/c4a306764392d49cee20ab5f98aeb59f.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/c4a306764392d49cee20ab5f98aeb59f.mp4?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/91b4be79715ae7daf568fb850c4fa35a.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" width=48 height=41 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/91b4be79715ae7daf568fb850c4fa35a.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Jogo de plataforma à moda antiga</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/c446fdd303f9c37f58d030b4e1a2230e.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" width=48 height=41 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/c446fdd303f9c37f58d030b4e1a2230e.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Thor parece familiar para os fãs do estilo retrô, mas também é único em suas próprias maneiras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ele apresenta verdadeira arte de pixel de 16 bits de Henk Nieborg e uma trilha sonora original de Chris Hülsbeck. Começando como um jogo de plataforma mais simples, Tiny Thor se desenvolve ao longo do caminho, à medida que você desbloqueia todos os tipos de habilidades que sonhava ter naquela época.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/89ad2aaff090e802c116843f1fc89d5a.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/89ad2aaff090e802c116843f1fc89d5a.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/89ad2aaff090e802c116843f1fc89d5a.mp4?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/91b4be79715ae7daf568fb850c4fa35a.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" width=48 height=41 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/91b4be79715ae7daf568fb850c4fa35a.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Lutas contra chefes dignos de uma jovem divindade</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/c446fdd303f9c37f58d030b4e1a2230e.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" width=48 height=41 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/c446fdd303f9c37f58d030b4e1a2230e.webm?t=1727774558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plataforma é recheada de emocionantes batalhas contra chefes que vão testar o filho de Odin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragr