p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" width=18 height=18 /></picture></span> Mestre martelo ricocheteando lance para dominar os inimigos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" width=18 height=18 /></picture></span> Aprenda incríveis habilidades especiais</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" width=18 height=18 /></picture></span> Explore mais de 30 níveis em três reinos distintos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" width=18 height=18 /></picture></span> Desafiantes lutas contra chefes, cada um com mecânica única</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" width=18 height=18 /></picture></span> Prepare o seu cérebro para resolver os complicados quebra-cabeças ambientais</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" width=18 height=18 /></picture></span> Descubra muitos segredos e colete joias escondidas para desbloquear níveis de desafios</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.apng?t=1727774558\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/541310/extras/e58a84da402eabfc11efe9bd93ca5a1f.poster.avif?t=1727774558\" class=\"bb_img\" width=18 height=18 /></picture></span> Aproveite a história de um menino assumindo a sua responsabilidade</p>",
